Z||000007||FieroKyle||07-20-2001||12:10 AM||||Well in my own belief, air does not get over to the rear spoiler because of the air flow over the cab of the car. I notice the back decklid and spoiler stays dry in heavy down pours. However the aero nose does help because with regular noses, the front end tends to lift up at high speeds while the GT style nose stays stuck to the ground.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sign_1.jpg">  <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>AOL Name: Yakty Yak<BR>E-Mail: YaktyYak@aol.com<P>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
Z||000008||Scott||07-20-2001||01:55 AM||||Hey guys,<BR>  There's an easy way to tell if the spoiler actually works: place ~3" strips of paper or plastic on it with small bits of duct tape.  Aircraft enthusiasts have been doing this for years as an alternative to wind tunnel testing.  If the strips stay straight at speed, then the air flow is good.   ||||reg||1
Z||000009||FieroKyle||07-20-2001||03:06 AM||||thats if airflow is good, if nothing is even hitting it, won't it stay straight?||||reg||1
Z||000010||Mach10||07-20-2001||03:17 AM||||Something will hit it, and the turbulent air caused by the notchback present on all current Fiero models will have the peice of paper whipping around like crazy. That's my theory, anyway...||||reg||7
Z||000011||rogergarrison||07-20-2001||06:04 AM||||figures can be manipulated to show anything they want. The whole body as a unit on the Indy car may have different numbers being that it was supposed to be driven over 100mph. But in general, the way its driven on the street, it has barely any effect other than keeping dirt off the tail lites unless your driving 150 mph every day. Look even at Nascar. If a cars spoiler is knocked off in an accident, it may not be competitive, but it still stays up within a few miles per hour of the rest of the field or they black flag them. Ill still stick to my guns on this one. Just for looks.. You dont know how many times with other makes with the little 'spoiler' ive heard the owner say it handles so much better on freeway......LOL.......BS.||||reg||1
